mium 89 G for a sword with loyalty discount, 2 years with MHPCO (100 G - 20 G loyalty + 5 G fee)\");\n\n  // --- First insurance surcharge (10%) ---\n  it.todo(\"should return premium 115 G for a sword as first insurance (100 G + 10 G first insurance + 5 G fee)\");\n\n  // --- Follow-up contract discount (15% on each contract after first) ---\n  it.todo(\"should return premium 94 G for a sword as second contract (100 G - 15 G follow-up discount + 5 G fee)\");\n\n  // --- Modifier scope on multi-item policies ---\n  it.todo(\"should apply cursed surcharge only to the cursed item, not policy total -- cursed sword (100 G), plain amulet (60 G) → 210 G before first-insurance/fee, final 236 G\");\n\n  // --- Integration example: Newcomer with cursed sword ---\n  it.todo(\"should return premium 165 G for newcomer (0 years, no previous contract) with cursed sword (steel, enchantment 3)\");\n\n  // --- Integration example: Long-standing customer's second contract ---\n  it.todo(\"should return premium 160 G for 3-year customer, second quote, cursed sword (enchantment 7)\");\n\n  // --- Integration: First insurance still applies to new item even on follow-up contract ---\n  it.todo(\"should apply first insurance surcharge even to long-standing customer's new item\");\n\n  // --- Rounding in MHPCO's favor ---\n  it.todo(\"should round premium 197.5 G → 198 G (round up)\");\n\n  // ============================================================\n  // CLAIM tests -- ordered simple to complex\n  // ============================================================\n\n  // --- Edge cases ---\n  it.todo(\"should exit with non-zero status for claim with damage entry whose item is not in policy\");\n  it.todo(\"should exit with non-zero status for claim with unknown item type in damages\");\n  it.todo(\"should exit with non-zero status for claim with negative damage amount (-200)\");\n  it.todo(\"should exit with non-zero status for claim with more damage entries of a type than insured\");\n\